#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:4
msgid "Software Licenses"
msgstr "Software Licencias"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Software Licenses section (|AdmSetLic|) enables automated application of"
" license keys to Instances during provisioning. This is primarily used for "
"Windows license management but supports any software requiring key-based "
"activation."
msgstr ""
"El Software Licencias sección (|AdmSetLic|) enables automated application de"
" licencia keys a Instancias durante aprovisionamiento. Este es primarily "
"usado para Windows licencia gestión pero supports cualquier software "
"requiring key-basado activation."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:11
msgid ""
"When a license is associated with a Virtual Image, |morpheus| automatically "
"applies the license key to any Instance provisioned using that image, "
"streamlining license management across your infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"Cuando a licencia es asociado con a Virtual Image, |morpheus| "
"automáticamente se aplica el licencia key a cualquier Instancia provisioned "
"usando ese image, streamlining licencia gestión a través de su "
"infraestructura."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:14
msgid "Role Permissions"
msgstr "Rol Permisos"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Administration: Settings** with ``Full`` access is required to manage "
"software licenses"
msgstr ""
"**Administration: Settings** con ``Full`` acceso es obligatorio a manage "
"software licencias"

