#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:71
msgid ""
"|morpheus| tracks the number of applied copies against the total available. "
"When all copies are consumed, additional provisioning with that license may "
"be restricted depending on the license type configuration."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| tracks el número de aplicado copies against el total disponible. "
"Cuando todos copies son consumed, adicional aprovisionamiento con ese "
"licencia puede be restricted dependiendo de el licencia tipo configuración."

